# Manual requests for the health blueprint.
# Run with the VS Code "REST Client" extension (humao.rest-client):
# start the server (`uv run flask run --debug`), then click "Send Request".

@baseUrl = http://127.0.0.1:5000

### Liveness check → 200 {"status": "ok"}
GET {{baseUrl}}/health

### Package version (from pyproject.toml) → 200 {"version": "..."}
GET {{baseUrl}}/version

### Unknown route → 404 application/problem+json
GET {{baseUrl}}/nope

### Wrong method → 405 problem+json with an Allow header
POST {{baseUrl}}/health
